    "Every Monday morning, a notification with what Downsweep cleaned the week before, and a card you can share.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Setiap Senin pagi, notifikasi berisi apa yang dibersihkan Downsweep minggu sebelumnya, beserta kartu yang bisa Anda bagikan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything Downsweep moves shows up here, and can be undone while it’s still in the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Semua yang dipindahkan Downsweep muncul di sini, dan bisa diurungkan selama masih ada di Tong Sampah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything goes to the Trash and can be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Semuanya masuk ke Tong Sampah dan bisa diurungkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
