      }
    },
    "Keep these items where they are. Downsweep won’t suggest them again; unpin them in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Biarkan item ini di tempatnya. Downsweep tidak akan menyarankannya lagi; lepas sematannya di Pengaturan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps your Downloads folder tidy, without rules to write.\nNothing is deleted: everything goes to the Trash and can be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menjaga folder Unduhan tetap rapi, tanpa perlu menulis aturan.\nTidak ada yang dihapus: semuanya masuk ke Tong Sampah dan bisa diurungkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
